senses.gloss:
नि-√ यम् P. -यच्छति, to stop (trans.), hold back, detain with (loc.) ;
 (Ā.) to stop (intrans.), stay, remain, RV.;
to keep back, refuse;
 (Ā.) to fail, be wanting, ib.;
to fasten, tie to (loc.), bind up (hair &c.), ib. &c. &c.;
to hold over, extend (शर्म), AV.;
to hold downwards (the hand), TS.;
to bring near, procure, bestow, grant, offer, present (rain, gifts &c.), RV.; AV.; Br. &c.;
to hold in, keep down, restrain, control, govern, regulate (as breath, the voice, the organs of sense &c.), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to suppress or conceal (one's nature), Mn. x, 59;
to destroy, annihilate (opp. to √ सृज्), BhP.;
to restrict (food &c.; cf. below);
to fix upon, settle, determine, establish, Sarvad.; Kathās.; BhP., Kāś. on Pāṇ. ii, 3, 66;
 (in gram.) to lower, pronounce low i.e. with the Anudātta, RPrāt. :
Caus. -यमयति, to restrain, curb, check, suppress, restrict, MBh.; Kāv. &c.

नि-√ या P. -याति, to pass over (with a carriage), RV. v, 35, 5; 42, 10; 54, 5;
to come down to (acc.), 75, 5;
to fall into, incur (acc.), ĀśvGṛ. i, 13, 7.

नि-√ 2. यु P. Ā. -यौति, or -युव॑ति, ˚ते, (1. sg. Ā. -युवे; Impv. 2. du. P. -युयोतम्; ind.p. -यूय),
to bind on, fasten, RV.; TBr.;
to bring near, procure, bestow, RV.; TS.;
 Intens. 3. sg. -योयुवे, RV. x, 93, 9.

नि-√ युज् P. Ā. -युनक्ति, -युङ्क्ते, to bind on, tie or fasten to (loc.), AV.; ŚBr.; MBh. &c.;
 (with धुरि) to tie to the pole of a carriage i.e. yoke, harness, R.;
 (met.) to place in front i.e. employ in the hardest work, ib. (also गुरु-धूर्षु, MBh.);
to join, put together (esp. the hands in a certain position; cf. कपोत) Sch. on Śak.;
to attach to i.e. make dependent on (dat. or loc.), AV.; ŚBr.;
to enjoin, order, command, coerce, impel, appoint, instal (double acc.), trust or charge with, direct or commission or authorize to (loc. dat., अर्थम् ifc., or infin.), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to confer or intrust anything (acc.) upon or to (loc.), R.; BhP.;
to place at, put in the way (with loc.), MBh.;
to direct towards, fix (mind or eyes upon, with loc.), ib.;
to use, employ, GṛS. :
Caus. -योजयति, to harness (horses &c.), put or tie to (loc.), Pañc.; Hit.;
to set or lay (a trap or snare &c.), Hit.;
to enjoin, urge, impel, coerce, appoint or instal as (double acc.), appoint to (loc.), direct or compel or request or command to (dat. loc. acc. with प्रति, or अर्थम् ifc.);
 commit or intrust anything (acc.) to (loc.), Mn.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to put in any place or state (loc.), ib.;
to confer or bestow upon (loc.), Kāv.; Pañc.; Pur.;
to use, employ (reason &c.), Pañc. i, 413 ;
to accomplish, perform (a rite), Mn. iii, 204;
to endow or furnish with, cause to partake of (instr.), Var.; Kāv.; Pañc.
